B.Nh=new A.kX("blckout","blckout","Order coffee, browse the menu, earn loyalty rewards, and track pickup updates with Blckout \u2014 your coffee shop app.",B.IS,B.Je,"assets/projects/blckout/branding.png","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.rlink.blckout&hl=en","https://apps.apple.com/us/app/blckout/id6758934818","Order coffee, browse the menu, earn rewards & get live order updates.\n\nORDER & PICKUP \u2014 Browse the full coffee menu, customize your drink, and get notified when your order is ready for pickup.\n\nLOYALTY REWARDS \u2014 Scan your QR code at checkout to earn points. Redeem rewards for free drinks and exclusive offers.\n\nMENU & OFFERS \u2014 Explore seasonal drinks, check ingredients, and stay updated on limited-time coffee shop deals.\n\nFAST & LIGHTWEIGHT \u2014 Optimized for speed and low data usage, with smart menu caching for a smooth experience.\n\n","2026")
